      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-02T18:55:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would remove this line altogether, as the configuration is set in stone at compilation time in the motion_sensors array, section `config[SENSOR_CONFIG_EC_S3].ec_rate`, set to CONFIG_ACCEL_FORCE_MODE_THRESHOLD_RATE_MS.",
